{"id":"vod_sn_39202","vodId":"39202","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"太空丹迪","name_cn":"太空丹迪","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ed38ea9211b00556a075b77ce43ce0e9.jpg"},"summary":"故事背景设定在不远的近未来，地球人的活动空间已触及到茫茫的外太空。故事主人公是一名叫丹迪（诹访部顺一 配音）的宇宙猎人，同时也是有名的花花公子。他和他的搭档——旧型清洁机器人QT（佐武宇绮 配音）一起在宇宙中寻找各种未知的新型外星物种，如果外星人被认定为新品种，那么谁最早发现谁就能获得奖金。在一次追捕中，丹迪和QT遇到一个外形像猫的外星人，丹迪取其名为“喵”（吉野裕行 配音）。从此，丹迪、QT和喵一同在宇宙中到处冒险，并与各种各样的外星人相遇，卷入一场场有趣刺激的故事中。　　本动画采用了“单元剧”的模式，使得这部动画像是一个舞台，各路人马各显神通。在展示的动画设计图中，有各式各样的外星人，监督表示动画播出时会每周推出一个外星人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vv5AumiBXE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qGsGxNTPs11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/diFTkDiHHH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rc0WaSxxKw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4P2EQHDSFK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7vZsZ3zXAQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xVvDqWLXNM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k2fpDLaHzW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ujBkt8r5Cw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R5c0H6Z73i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Jb4fnz1DH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Di7SvdHu711/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uabSswbM421/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s1Nya3xGH81/vid